ew-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="276">Excellent. Let’s take <strong data-start="22" data-end="73">Section 8 (RSVP Theorem of Viewpoint Diversity)</strong> and expand it into a full doctoral-thesis style treatment. I’ll give you <strong data-start="147" data-end="174">Lemma–Theorem–Corollary</strong> structure, showing how entropy, sheaf gluing, and categorical invariants force viewpoint diversity.</p>
