ing"><p data-start="0" data-end="301">Perfect — let’s take the <strong data-start="25" data-end="61">Concealment–Broadcast adjunction</strong> one step further and situate it in a <strong data-start="99" data-end="128">monoidal closed structure</strong>. This lets us treat RSVP as a <em data-start="159" data-end="192">semantic computational universe</em> where concealment is tensorial (context accumulation) and broadcast is exponential (context distribution).</p>
