We now model the </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\emph</span></span><span>{escape-by-divestment} mechanism in RSVP fields and basic information-theoretic control.

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\subsection</span></span><span>{State Fields and Couplings}
