Coupling between the agentic core (Self) and the marker is represented by a correlation potential </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>C(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\Phi</span></span><span>,M)</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> and a transport affinity </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>A(</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{v},M)</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>.

