<ul data-start="2459" data-end="2727">
<li data-start="2459" data-end="2564">
<p data-start="2461" data-end="2564">Custom macros for RSVP notation (<span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi, \mathbf{v}, S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8778em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord">Φ</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathbf" style="margin-right: 0.01597em;">v</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span></span></span></span>), entropy thresholds, and colimit operators.</p>
