</li>
<li data-start="2631" data-end="2727">
<p data-start="2633" data-end="2727">Toy lattice models demonstrating entropy smoothing and viewpoint concealment.<br data-start="2710" data-end="2713">
<em data-start="2713" data-end="2727">(6–8 pages.)</em></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2729" data-end="2732">
<h3 data-start="2734" data-end="2788">Appendix G: Extended Mathematical Infrastructure</h3>
<ul data-start="2789" data-end="3073">
<li data-start="2789" data-end="2876">
<p data-start="2791" data-end="2876"><strong data-start="2791" data-end="2811">Category theory:</strong> symmetric monoidal categories, adjunctions, functorial merges.</p>
