<li data-start="2958" data-end="3073">
<p data-start="2960" data-end="3073"><strong data-start="2960" data-end="2985">Topological analysis:</strong> spectral gaps, crystalline resets, Poincaré recurrence formalization.<br data-start="3055" data-end="3058">
