<ul data-start="3124" data-end="3345">
<li data-start="3124" data-end="3256">
<p data-start="3126" data-end="3256">Expanded notes on key sources: Alter (Job), Baars (GWT), Blum &amp; Blum (CTM), Friston (FEP), Smolin (CNS), Al-Khwarizmi (Algebra).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3257" data-end="3345">
<p data-start="3259" data-end="3345">Commentary on interpretive controversies and how they link into RSVP.<br data-start="3328" data-end="3331">
<em data-start="3331" data-end="3345">(4–6 pages.)</em></p>
