<hr data-start="3347" data-end="3350">
<p data-start="3352" data-end="3569">That way, your appendices run <strong data-start="3382" data-end="3397">A through H</strong>, scaling from philology and textual analysis to heavy equations, computational complexity, artifacts, poetry, simulation code, formal math, and bibliographic commentary.</p>
