u like the style of <strong data-start="33" data-end="39">#3</strong>, here are some variations in that same register, emphasizing RSVP’s balance of entropy and order while tying in computation and consciousness:</p>
<ol data-start="184" data-end="859">
<li data-start="184" data-end="315">
<p data-start="187" data-end="315"><strong data-start="187" data-end="266">Viewpoint Diversity: Entropy, Balance, and the Computation of Consciousness</strong><br data-start="266" data-end="269">
– puts computation as the active process.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="317" data-end="449">
<p data-start="320" data-end="449"><strong data-start="320" data-end="398">Viewpoint Diversity: Entropy, Restoration, and Computational Consciousness</strong><br data-start="398" data-end="401">
– “restoration” ties directly to <em data-start="437" data-end="446" data-is-only-node="">al-jabr</em>.</p>
