<li data-start="451" data-end="616">
<p data-start="454" data-end="616"><strong data-start="454" data-end="525">Viewpoint Diversity: Entropy, Balance, and the Architecture of Mind</strong><br data-start="525" data-end="528">
– swaps in “architecture” for a broader resonance across computation and cognition.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="618" data-end="751">
<p data-start="621" data-end="751"><strong data-start="621" data-end="706">Viewpoint Diversity: Entropic Balance and the Rise of Computational Consciousness</strong><br data-start="706" data-end="709">
– more narrative, suggests emergence.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="753" data-end="859">
<p data-start="756" data-end="859"><strong data-start="756" data-end="824">Viewpoint Diversity: Balance, Entropy, and Conscious Computation</strong><br data-start="824" data-end="827">
– tight, rhythmic phrasing.</p>
</li>
