a-start="18" data-end="50">“syncretization experiments”</strong> signals both your fusion of traditions and frameworks, and that the work is exploratory, provisional, not final.</p>
<p data-start="167" data-end="233">If you want close variants in the same register, here are a few:</p>
<ul data-start="235" data-end="530">
<li data-start="235" data-end="282">
<p data-start="237" data-end="282"><strong data-start="237" data-end="263">“syncretization draft”</strong> – simple, clear.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="283" data-end="342">
<p data-start="285" data-end="342"><strong data-start="285" data-end="312">“syncretization trials”</strong> – evokes iterative testing.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="343" data-end="396">
<p data-start="345" data-end="396"><strong data-start="345" data-end="377">“syncretization in-progress”</strong> – very Git-like.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="397" data-end="467">
<p data-start="399" data-end="467"><strong data-start="399" data-end="431">“syncretization scaffolding”</strong> – suggests framework being built.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="468" data-end="530">
<p data-start="470" data-end="530"><strong data-start="470" data-end="499">“syncretization sketches”</strong> – playful, early-stage feel.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="532" data-end="736" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Would you like me to also propose some <strong data-start="571" data-end="597">shorter one-word forms</strong> (like “syncretizing” or “resynthesizing”) that still carry that “incomplete” flavor, so you have an option for ultra-concise commit style?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791